        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "R. Principals will cooperate with teachers in making arrangements for a break in either the morning or afternoon. When vocational courses are taught in three (3) hour blocks and students are given a break, teachers shall be entitled to the same break. In schools where principals have not been able to facilitate breaks, teachers may utilize at least ten (10) minutes of their planning time or a reasonable amount of student passing time as a duty-free break.",
            "block_bbox": [
                38,
                279,
