        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "S. Teachers shall attend faculty meetings as called by the principal. Any meetings called to solicit funds from teachers shall be pre-announced as to the meeting's purpose, and teacher attendance shall be voluntary. Except during pre-planning and post-planning, faculty meetings shall not exceed approximately one (1) hour per week, except for emergencies.",
            "block_bbox": [
                39,
